<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL - IDEAL RIGHTS START TRADING.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - IDEAL RIGHTS START TRADING.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said Ideal Group rights will start trading on Wednesday with a daily volatility limit of +/- 8.0 percent.</p>
<p>The minimum trading lot will be 10 rights.</p>
<p>The opening price will be 10 drachmas for both -- common and preferred. A total of 5,377,775 rights for common shares and 400,000 for preferred shares were issued. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
